# Agent memory files. Gamut Toolbox writes its own managed blocks into these at runtime
# (project identity, Storybook URL, Digger handoff) and clears them on quit, so the
# working copy is per-machine session state rather than source.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
GEMINI.md

# Managed preview-styling block Gamut Toolbox writes into a project's own Storybook
# config (ensurePreviewHead in main.js) — runtime output, not source, even for this repo.
**/.storybook/preview-head.html
